{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgovXrXZi3HPSM7MemkeX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm going to stop here. I've read six screens and my eyes are tired.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:**\n\"Listen, I found the right place. The page is called 'מה האתר עוד לא מכסה', and it says plainly at the top: 'החוקים והכללים לכל המוצרים כאן עוד בבדיקה. עד שייסגרו, האתר לא מחשב אותם.' So none of the things on that list get compared. The ones that matter to me are **פיקדון מובנה**, **מוצר מובנה**, **פיקדון במטבע חוץ**, **צמוד דולר**, the **מענק** on a structured deposit, **ביטוח מנהלים**, **פוליסות חיסכון / ביטוח חיים משתתף ברווחים**, and **אג\"ח קונצרניות**. Gold and some other things are on it too. Every card has the same red label, 'לא מחושב'. I'm fairly sure about this. I didn't get to the bottom, though, so the list may be longer. Before I rely on the site for anything, especially those deposits the bank offers, I'll ask you or the bank.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **Screen 1:** the title, the red notice, and the first cards: ETC, LBMA gold, אג\"ח קונצרניות, אגרת בונדס.\n- **Screen 2:** ארנק מט\"ח דיגיטלי, ביטוח חיים משתתף ברווחים, ביטוח מנהלים, היוון קצבה.\n- **Screen 3:** הסדר חוב and gold through a fund.\n- **Screen 4:** מוצר מובנה, מנוטרלת מט\"ח, מענק, מסלולי האירוע.\n- **Screen 5:** נע\"מ, עמלת חליפין, and a card about an investment manager.\n- **Screen 6:** פיקדון במטבע חוץ, a savings policy, צמוד דולר, פיקדון מובנה.\n- I read mainly the headings and the line under 'מה ידוע'.\n\n**What I skipped:**\n- The blue lines naming laws and page numbers. They're long and I lost my place in them.\n- The dates, the little 'חוקים וכללים · 3' tags, and 'מקור ראשי'.\n- The grey 'כשייסגר: ...' sentence on each card. It's pale and long.\n- Screens 7 to 10, and the two securities-account screens I'd already read before.\n\n**Where I hesitated or wasn't sure:**\n- 'שאלה פתוחה' with codes like 'MF-28', 'TX2-01' and 'TXA-28'. I don't know what they mean.\n- Some lines are crossed out, like 'נסגר ב-24.10.2026'. Is that question closed, or cancelled?\n- 'לפי החברה' in orange.\n- ETC, LBMA, AM / PM, ICE: I can only read the letters out.\n- 'קרן מחקה', 'השקעה במדד', 'מסלולי האירוע', 'מנוטרלת מט\"ח'. These mean nothing to me.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The whole screen is black with small grey writing. The pale lines I couldn't read even with my glasses.\n- Every card has a red 'לא מחושב' and a red lock. It scared me a little.\n- Two columns of cards full of laws and dates is very busy.\n- There's no short list at the top saying \"these are the things we don't do yet\". You have to go through every card."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3727,"cache_read_input_tokens":11586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3727},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fe94d496-46ff-4114-a8cd-f55096f3afe9","uuid":"9a6f23b4-b72e-4ca8-871d-47c5b370a776","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:59:26.484Z","request_id":"req_011CgovXrHBsxX3LySs7dzsp"}
